    "name": "Escape Of The Hammer Princess",
    "steam_appid": 3136530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BASH SOME SKULLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/733eba819d80fe91c3611a9b96d541bd.poster.avif?t=1747950299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/733eba819d80fe91c3611a9b96d541bd.webm?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/733eba819d80fe91c3611a9b96d541bd.mp4?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the armies of the undead, in this retro-styled romp that plays in both <strong>3D</strong> and <strong> 2D</strong>! Explore levels in 2D as the heroes of legend, and then do them in 3D as the hammer princess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by<strong> boomer shooters</strong> of the 90s, and <strong>2D platformers</strong> of the 80s, this brand new twist on a classic formula sees you playing as both the heroes rescuing the princess, and the princess escaping by herself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN 3D...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/3dc0c3c347538d292ca2c712c5dce6d2.poster.avif?t=1747950299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/3dc0c3c347538d292ca2c712c5dce6d2.webm?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/3dc0c3c347538d292ca2c712c5dce6d2.mp4?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, float and fight your way through the lands of the undead, in exciting first-person action levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemies using your trusty, life-leeching Hammer! Swing it, throw it, crush foes, walls and furniture alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet with the souls of fallen heroes, learn from their deaths, and add their weapons to your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape this wicked kingdom, and rise as a legend!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >... AND 2D</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/b0eceb23518093d6d41b02e098bd93a8.poster.avif?t=1747950299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/b0eceb23518093d6d41b02e098bd93a8.webm?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/b0eceb23518093d6d41b02e098bd93a8.mp4?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit the past, in classical platformer style, as you live the story of the fallen heroes and how they came to an end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with each heroes' weapons and abilities, as you master the tools that you'll later use in 3D!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle the undead in a whole new dimension! Experience the same enemies and bosses in both gameplay formats, and use what you learn in one to succeed in the other!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from the mistakes of the past, in order to rise above, and defeat the Monarch of the Skulls once and for all!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer Princess Team is:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facundo Nahuel Colombo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facundo Ignacio Gonzalez Gimenez</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rodrigo Le\u00f3n Magari\u00f1os</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carolina Luciana C\u00e1ndido</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Santiago Roque D'Angelo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer Princess Team is NOT a legal entity, it is our current team name.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BASH SOME SKULLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/733eba819d80fe91c3611a9b96d541bd.poster.avif?t=1747950299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/733eba819d80fe91c3611a9b96d541bd.webm?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/733eba819d80fe91c3611a9b96d541bd.mp4?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the armies of the undead, in this retro-styled romp that plays in both <strong>3D</strong> and <strong> 2D</strong>! Explore levels in 2D as the heroes of legend, and then do them in 3D as the hammer princess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by<strong> boomer shooters</strong> of the 90s, and <strong>2D platformers</strong> of the 80s, this brand new twist on a classic formula sees you playing as both the heroes rescuing the princess, and the princess escaping by herself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN 3D...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/3dc0c3c347538d292ca2c712c5dce6d2.poster.avif?t=1747950299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/3dc0c3c347538d292ca2c712c5dce6d2.webm?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/3dc0c3c347538d292ca2c712c5dce6d2.mp4?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, float and fight your way through the lands of the undead, in exciting first-person action levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemies using your trusty, life-leeching Hammer! Swing it, throw it, crush foes, walls and furniture alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet with the souls of fallen heroes, learn from their deaths, and add their weapons to your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape this wicked kingdom, and rise as a legend!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >... AND 2D</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/b0eceb23518093d6d41b02e098bd93a8.poster.avif?t=1747950299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/b0eceb23518093d6d41b02e098bd93a8.webm?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136530/extras/b0eceb23518093d6d41b02e098bd93a8.mp4?t=1747950299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit the past, in classical platformer style, as you live the story of the fallen heroes and how they came to an end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with each heroes' weapons and abilities, as you master the tools that you'll later use in 3D!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle the undead in a whole new dimension! Experience the same enemies and bosses in both gameplay formats, and use what you learn in one to succeed in the other!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from the mistakes of the past, in order to rise above, and defeat the Monarch of the Skulls once and for all!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer Princess Team is:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facundo Nahuel Colombo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facundo Ignacio Gonzalez Gimenez</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rodrigo Le\u00f3n Magari\u00f1os</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carolina Luciana C\u00e1ndido</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Santiago Roque D'Angelo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer Princess Team is NOT a legal entity, it is our current team name.</p>",
